From 8af3a1c5063323c7224e1a68133ed6f47a1d7622 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 07:47:39 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] chronik: native Lotus V2 extension skeleton and native output
 types
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds chronik/native/ext/lotus_v2, the V2-tier extension of the native
Chronik (design C1 §5.1), built as chronik_native_lotus_v2 on the core.
Areas add their sources through ext/lotus_v2/<area>/sources.cmake.

types.{h,cpp} port bitcoinsuite-core/src/lotus_v2.rs: Hash32/TxId/TxHash/
OutPoint, the native Output with its structural validation and canonical
frame codec (same error categories), BranchWitness/Input/Transaction and
the confirmed TxLocation/SpendLocation/OutputRecord. The tests are the Rust
ones, run against the same fixtures (native_outputs.json).

Tier: V2
